+---
+id: task-001-implement-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution for the package.
+
+Acceptance criteria:
+
+- `src/index.ts` exports `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`.
+- It resolves object members and array elements using RFC 6901 token decoding.
+- It returns the document for the empty pointer and preserves values including `null`.
+- It rejects malformed pointer syntax and pointers that cannot resolve to a document value.
+- Automated tests cover RFC examples, escaping, invalid syntax, and unresolved paths.
